WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:52.923
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:53.193 --> 00:56.213
[Episode 3. I've Never Been the Only One Naked]

3
01:07.278 --> 01:10.104
What's with this vibe?

4
01:10.679 --> 01:12.538
Don't tell me...

5
01:32.392 --> 01:35.694
Looks like the cramp's gone.

6
01:35.694 --> 01:38.283
You could've said something.

7
01:46.611 --> 01:50.306
That cramp went away fast.

8
01:51.489 --> 01:53.679
You're good at massages.

9
01:55.941 --> 01:59.497
Anyway, see you Monday.

10
01:59.497 --> 02:01.447
What are you talking about?

11
02:02.208 --> 02:04.788
We've got work to finish tomorrow.

12
02:06.838 --> 02:08.575
What a monster.

13
02:14.721 --> 02:16.386
See you tomorrow.

14
02:49.540 --> 02:51.758
Already? It's noon?

15
02:51.758 --> 02:54.983
No wonder I'm starving.

16
02:55.553 --> 02:57.889
Wait, that jerk...

17
02:57.889 --> 03:01.607
He made me come in, but he's not even here?

18
03:02.936 --> 03:04.647
Unbelievable.

19
03:06.397 --> 03:07.774
How much?

20
03:07.774 --> 03:09.776
Why is jajangmyeon so expensive?

21
03:09.776 --> 03:12.195
That's the going rate around here.

22
03:12.195 --> 03:15.894
With this rent, we have no choice.

23
03:16.407 --> 03:18.800
Business is slow enough as it is.

24
03:19.327 --> 03:21.788
Fair point.

25
03:21.788 --> 03:24.207
Then one order of jajangmyeon, please.

26
03:24.207 --> 03:26.501
We can't deliver just one.

27
03:26.501 --> 03:29.480
You need to meet the order minimum.

28
03:30.546 --> 03:33.174
How much is that?

29
03:33.174 --> 03:34.509
Twenty thousand won.

30
03:34.509 --> 03:36.094
Twenty...

31
03:36.094 --> 03:38.927
Twenty thousand won?

32
03:41.057 --> 03:43.226
Okay, I'll figure something out.

33
03:43.226 --> 03:44.917
Yeah.

34
03:50.274 --> 03:52.647
Should've brought cup noodles.

35
03:59.117 --> 04:00.943
Oh, my!

36
04:01.536 --> 04:03.162
You've been here?

37
04:03.162 --> 04:05.915
You could've told me!

38
04:05.915 --> 04:09.460
You expect your boss to report to his secretary?

39
04:09.460 --> 04:12.088
Okay, maybe not.

40
04:12.964 --> 04:14.382
Had lunch yet?

41
04:14.382 --> 04:15.717
Let's eat together.

42
04:15.717 --> 04:17.057
I want jajangmyeon.

43
04:17.057 --> 04:20.430
I've never had a woman tell me she wants jajangmyeon.

44
04:20.430 --> 04:22.265
Then we can eat separately.

45
04:22.265 --> 04:24.434
Not going to meet me halfway, are you?

46
04:24.434 --> 04:26.853
You could meet me halfway.

47
04:26.853 --> 04:28.312
Then lunch is on me.

48
04:28.312 --> 04:30.815
I can afford a bowl of noodles myself.

49
04:30.815 --> 04:33.392
Yeah? Then you pay.

50
04:34.318 --> 04:37.238
Since when are you so modest about money?

51
04:37.238 --> 04:38.322
Deal!

52
04:38.322 --> 04:40.171
But...

53
04:40.171 --> 04:42.190
Does that place serve anything else?

54
04:42.190 --> 04:44.844
No. We're having jajangmyeon.

55
04:45.872 --> 04:47.638
Oh, hello!

56
04:47.638 --> 04:49.327
I just called a moment ago.

57
04:51.368 --> 04:53.232
Looks good.

58
04:57.845 --> 05:00.072
See. Like this...

59
05:07.041 --> 05:08.927
This place knows its noodles.

60
05:11.330 --> 05:12.815
So good!

61
05:12.815 --> 05:15.348
Guess you get what you pay for.

62
05:17.188 --> 05:19.947
You'd never waste a bite, even on your deathbed.

63
05:19.947 --> 05:21.881
You don't like jajangmyeon?

64
05:26.662 --> 05:27.997
Not really.

65
05:27.997 --> 05:30.458
How can anyone hate jajangmyeon?

66
05:30.458 --> 05:32.293
How can you eat it so happily?

67
05:32.293 --> 05:33.920
That's what baffles me.

68
05:33.920 --> 05:36.380
Oh, right. You don't have a favorite food?

69
05:36.380 --> 05:39.940
I said I've never thought about it.

70
05:42.428 --> 05:44.288
Come on.

71
05:44.288 --> 05:45.835
Eat up!

72
05:45.835 --> 05:48.226
I'm buying, so humor me.

73
05:48.226 --> 05:49.570
Here.

74
05:50.603 --> 05:54.315
Let me mix some in for you.

75
05:54.315 --> 05:55.530
There.

76
05:58.861 --> 06:00.321
What are you doing?

77
06:00.321 --> 06:02.281
With your used chopsticks?

78
06:02.281 --> 06:04.367
Seriously...

79
06:04.367 --> 06:05.576
Sorry.

80
06:05.576 --> 06:07.822
I'm so, so sorry.

81
06:10.581 --> 06:12.100
Give me your chopsticks.

82
06:15.545 --> 06:19.265
Now, you have to eat it.

83
06:24.720 --> 06:26.180
Try it.

84
06:26.180 --> 06:27.306
Stop it.

85
06:27.306 --> 06:28.391
Come on, try it!

86
06:28.391 --> 06:29.600
I said stop.

87
06:29.600 --> 06:31.566
Just try it!

88
06:33.896 --> 06:35.596
Oh, no!

89
06:37.429 --> 06:38.609
Oh, no!

90
06:38.609 --> 06:40.528
What do I do?

91
06:40.528 --> 06:41.612
Seriously...

92
06:41.612 --> 06:43.587
Hold on!

93
06:43.587 --> 06:44.614
Wipes...

94
06:44.614 --> 06:45.981
Where are they?

95
06:45.981 --> 06:47.702
Oh, my gosh.

96
06:47.702 --> 06:50.448
Of course it's a white shirt...

97
06:54.584 --> 06:55.609
Oh, no.

98
06:55.609 --> 06:58.510
I can't believe this.

99
06:59.505 --> 07:03.204
Well, you should've taken the bite!

100
07:03.204 --> 07:04.594
Oh, my...

101
07:04.594 --> 07:05.938
Hold still.

102
07:13.345 --> 07:17.857
Wow, why is your chest so hard?

103
07:17.857 --> 07:20.763
You're just spreading the stain.

104
07:21.402 --> 07:22.821
Then...

105
07:23.487 --> 07:24.655
Take it off.

106
07:24.655 --> 07:26.450
I'll wash it for you.

107
07:26.450 --> 07:27.950
Forget it.

108
07:27.950 --> 07:29.686
Go buy me a new one.

109
07:29.686 --> 07:32.121
What's your favorite color?

110
07:32.121 --> 07:33.633
Why do you ask?

111
07:33.633 --> 07:35.417
You told me to buy a shirt.

112
07:35.417 --> 07:37.766
I need to know what color you like...

113
07:39.264 --> 07:42.256
Don't tell me you don't have one.

114
07:42.256 --> 07:43.600
Never thought about it.

115
07:43.600 --> 07:46.527
Seheon Department Store, sixth floor. They'll know.

116
07:46.527 --> 07:49.180
So your tastes, even your favorite colors...

117
07:49.180 --> 07:52.314
You let other people choose for you?

118
07:55.019 --> 07:58.731
Stop asking and go get it. Now!

119
07:58.731 --> 08:00.611
Yes, sir.

120
08:02.318 --> 08:05.736
But they'll just give it to me, right?

121
08:05.736 --> 08:07.198
Yes. Just go.

122
08:07.198 --> 08:08.631
Understood.

123
08:14.632 --> 08:17.432
This is Mr. Kwon's usual brand.

124
08:20.169 --> 08:21.337
This one?

125
08:21.337 --> 08:22.877
Oh, yes.

126
08:24.131 --> 08:25.728
I'll get the same one ready.

127
08:25.728 --> 08:27.851
Okay. Thank you.

128
08:39.040 --> 08:41.098
That's expensive.

129
08:46.876 --> 08:48.917
Your shirt's here.

130
08:52.441 --> 08:54.212
Oh, my!

131
08:55.604 --> 08:58.525
I'll take it out for you.

132
09:08.426 --> 09:09.719
Oh, my...

133
09:09.719 --> 09:12.045
Just a moment, please.

134
09:13.402 --> 09:15.052
Here you go.

135
09:31.324 --> 09:33.978
What should I do with this one?

136
09:34.535 --> 09:36.009
Toss it.

137
09:37.009 --> 09:39.165
"Toss it?"

138
09:39.165 --> 09:40.235
But...

139
09:40.235 --> 09:43.080
Does he know how much this costs?

140
09:43.080 --> 09:44.755
Unbelievable.

141
09:56.469 --> 09:58.809
So, you have an alternative?

142
09:58.809 --> 10:00.975
Yes, absolutely.

143
10:01.573 --> 10:05.495
Aimi writes her own songs.

144
10:05.495 --> 10:07.485
We can say she's working on new music

145
10:07.485 --> 10:09.695
and keep her out of the press.

146
10:09.695 --> 10:13.115
As for New OX, they've been on a break.

147
10:13.115 --> 10:15.785
If we bring the full group back,

148
10:15.785 --> 10:18.228
we'll get everyone talking,

149
10:18.228 --> 10:21.290
and that incident from last time

150
10:21.290 --> 10:23.547
will fade from the headlines.

151
10:23.547 --> 10:25.415
That's our proposal.

152
10:26.212 --> 10:27.588
So for this new single,

153
10:27.588 --> 10:30.431
we've gone all out on the group's return.

154
10:33.087 --> 10:34.426
Shall I call them?

155
10:34.426 --> 10:35.953
Come on in.

156
11:15.258 --> 11:17.415
Could you step out for a minute?

157
11:20.641 --> 11:23.018
These kids' futures are at stake.

158
11:23.018 --> 11:24.895
What about this company's future?

159
11:24.895 --> 11:27.398
And what about our KPIs?

160
11:27.398 --> 11:28.524
Forget the numbers.

161
11:28.524 --> 11:30.548
Give us a vision for this company.

162
11:30.548 --> 11:32.236
You don't like our idea?

163
11:32.236 --> 11:33.841
Then tell us why.

164
11:33.841 --> 11:35.694
Or give us a better one.

165
11:35.694 --> 11:37.059
Come on.

166
11:37.059 --> 11:38.260
What's with you?

167
11:38.260 --> 11:41.162
You know he's new to this idol business.

168
11:41.162 --> 11:44.141
Sir, if idol music isn't your area,

169
11:44.141 --> 11:47.188
maybe you should leave it to us.

170
11:47.188 --> 11:49.086
If you want my trust,

171
11:49.086 --> 11:52.214
bring me a strategy I can count on.

172
11:52.214 --> 11:55.642
I need a game changer to boost our KPIs.

173
11:55.642 --> 11:57.322
Bring me one.

174
12:00.737 --> 12:02.410
Sir...

175
12:03.227 --> 12:05.170
Oh, my gosh...

176
12:05.170 --> 12:07.231
By the way, what's a KPI?

177
12:07.231 --> 12:09.261
KPI, KPI...

178
12:11.635 --> 12:13.347
[Euneunhan Cleaners]

179
12:21.076 --> 12:22.472
What?

180
12:23.689 --> 12:25.498
What's in it?

181
12:25.498 --> 12:27.372
Oh, it's just...

182
12:27.908 --> 12:29.376
This one, right?

183
12:29.376 --> 12:30.669
This one.

184
12:30.669 --> 12:32.880
Why do you have a man's shirt?

185
12:32.880 --> 12:35.289
Whose shirt is this?

186
12:35.289 --> 12:36.802
I just found it somewhere.

187
12:36.802 --> 12:38.800
Found it?

188
12:38.800 --> 12:40.971
This fabric is top-notch.

189
12:40.971 --> 12:43.044
Smells nice, too...

190
12:44.072 --> 12:45.599
What's that smell?

191
12:45.599 --> 12:46.779
Jaja...

192
12:46.779 --> 12:48.383
That's it.

193
12:48.383 --> 12:50.272
Jajangmyeon!

194
12:50.272 --> 12:52.750
My nose never fails me.

195
12:54.371 --> 12:57.279
Oh, tomorrow's Sunday.

196
12:57.279 --> 12:59.080
Eun Chae.

197
12:59.080 --> 13:01.440
Let's get jajangmyeon tomorrow!

198
13:01.977 --> 13:03.577
Dad.

199
13:03.577 --> 13:05.413
I work tomorrow.

200
13:06.288 --> 13:08.094
On a Sunday?

201
13:08.807 --> 13:10.376
Well, look at my girl!

202
13:10.376 --> 13:12.462
Work must love you!

203
13:15.695 --> 13:17.295
Guess so.

204
13:18.634 --> 13:19.721
Good!

205
13:19.721 --> 13:22.012
I love it.

206
13:22.012 --> 13:24.223
Have some noodles before you go.

207
13:24.223 --> 13:25.641
Yeah.

208
13:25.641 --> 13:26.927
Okay!

209
13:53.821 --> 13:55.734
[Drop Your Dreams Here!]

210
14:02.469 --> 14:05.535
Wonder if they tossed ours, too...

211
14:28.829 --> 14:30.596
Come in.

212
14:37.288 --> 14:38.547
Yes.

213
14:38.547 --> 14:40.090
Get me antacids.

214
14:40.090 --> 14:42.217
Indigestion? What did you eat?

215
14:42.217 --> 14:43.811
Jajangmyeon.

216
14:43.811 --> 14:45.878
Jajangmyeon!

217
14:45.878 --> 14:48.265
That was hours ago!

218
14:48.265 --> 14:49.516
See?

219
14:49.516 --> 14:51.629
You didn't enjoy it. That's why.

220
14:51.629 --> 14:53.422
Just get out.

221
14:54.221 --> 14:56.131
Hold on a second.

222
15:10.245 --> 15:12.665
Why do you carry that around?

223
15:12.665 --> 15:16.868
You never know when you'll need it.

224
15:16.868 --> 15:19.194
Give me your hand.

225
15:20.547 --> 15:21.931
Come on.

226
15:24.169 --> 15:28.749
Okay, let's get the blood flowing.

227
15:30.062 --> 15:31.662
There we go.

228
15:32.935 --> 15:34.940
Is all this touching necessary?

229
15:34.940 --> 15:39.982
I have to work it down before I prick your finger.

230
15:46.320 --> 15:47.783
Does it hurt?

231
15:47.783 --> 15:49.941
Never had your finger pricked?

232
15:52.579 --> 15:54.206
It stings a little.

233
15:54.206 --> 15:58.001
The needle goes in about a centimeter.

234
15:58.001 --> 16:00.194
Why so deep?

235
16:00.194 --> 16:01.296
Scared?

236
16:01.296 --> 16:03.507
Close your eyes if you are.

237
16:03.507 --> 16:04.829
No.

238
16:04.829 --> 16:06.442
Forget it.

239
16:07.132 --> 16:09.054
Here comes the pinch.

240
16:09.054 --> 16:10.789
Wait!

241
16:12.599 --> 16:14.226
You're doing it right now?

242
16:14.226 --> 16:17.095
On three, okay?

243
16:17.095 --> 16:18.687
- Three? - Yes.

244
16:18.687 --> 16:20.019
Three...

245
16:20.816 --> 16:23.399
One, two, three!

246
16:26.095 --> 16:27.906
Kidding.

247
16:27.906 --> 16:29.957
For real this time.

248
16:31.309 --> 16:32.675
One...

249
16:32.675 --> 16:33.955
Oh, my!

250
16:33.955 --> 16:35.122
Three! Three!

251
16:35.122 --> 16:36.331
That was one!

252
16:36.331 --> 16:38.205
Look. You really are sick.

253
16:38.205 --> 16:40.085
Look at that dark blood.

254
16:40.085 --> 16:41.378
Oh, no.

255
16:41.378 --> 16:43.368
That must've hurt.

256
16:44.451 --> 16:45.991
All right.

257
16:46.775 --> 16:49.510
Now let's get a good burp out of you.

258
16:49.510 --> 16:51.472
That's enough.

259
16:51.472 --> 16:53.997
Don't be shy!

260
16:53.997 --> 16:55.343
Stop pounding my back.

261
16:55.343 --> 16:56.852
It hurts.

262
16:56.852 --> 16:58.629
Oh, it hurts?

263
17:02.608 --> 17:06.377
So... what song have you had on all day?

264
17:06.377 --> 17:08.318
It's our new single.

265
17:08.318 --> 17:09.617
I can't stand it.

266
17:09.617 --> 17:10.722
Why not?

267
17:10.722 --> 17:14.298
I don't listen to music with vocals.

268
17:14.298 --> 17:15.329
Why?

269
17:15.329 --> 17:17.397
Too noisy.

270
17:20.543 --> 17:22.994
Well, fair enough.

271
17:22.994 --> 17:25.964
Music's a matter of taste.

272
17:25.964 --> 17:27.883
But I think...

273
17:27.883 --> 17:30.455
music isn't about genre.

274
17:30.455 --> 17:32.656
It's about the world an artist creates.

275
17:32.656 --> 17:36.227
Whether it's a song or an instrumental.

276
17:36.227 --> 17:38.067
Their own world?

277
17:39.052 --> 17:41.705
What does music mean to you?

278
17:41.705 --> 17:42.940
To me,

279
17:42.940 --> 17:47.110
music connects people across time and space.

280
17:47.110 --> 17:49.856
And it brings comfort.

281
17:49.856 --> 17:51.497
I don't know about that.

282
17:53.717 --> 17:55.953
Think about birthdays.

283
17:55.953 --> 17:57.663
When the people you love

284
17:57.663 --> 18:00.377
sing Happy Birthday to you,

285
18:00.377 --> 18:02.935
it makes you feel great, right?

286
18:04.545 --> 18:07.923
When my mom finished singing Happy Birthday,

287
18:07.923 --> 18:11.750
she'd sprinkle magic dust on the cake.

288
18:11.750 --> 18:15.369
She'd tell me to make a wish.

289
18:16.765 --> 18:18.557
Enough. Get out.

290
18:18.557 --> 18:19.585
Did you burp?

291
18:19.585 --> 18:22.729
I'm not going to. Drop it.

292
18:22.729 --> 18:24.245
Okay.

293
18:31.738 --> 18:34.116
When the people you love

294
18:34.116 --> 18:36.410
sing Happy Birthday to you,

295
18:36.410 --> 18:38.756
it makes you feel great, right?

296
18:44.501 --> 18:48.714
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

297
18:48.714 --> 18:52.134
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

298
18:52.134 --> 18:56.145
♪ Dear my Do Hyeok ♪

299
18:56.145 --> 18:59.831
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

300
19:03.061 --> 19:06.231
Making someone happy...

301
19:45.354 --> 19:47.272
Did you burp?

302
19:47.272 --> 19:50.776
I told you to drop it.

303
19:50.776 --> 19:54.655
And if you keep playing that music, you can go home.

304
19:54.655 --> 19:56.299
Really?

305
19:56.299 --> 19:59.330
I should've played music hours ago!

306
19:59.330 --> 20:01.947
I mean stop playing it from now on.

307
20:03.872 --> 20:07.257
Those albums left in the lobby...

308
20:07.257 --> 20:08.812
Never listened to these?

309
20:08.812 --> 20:11.213
They worked so hard on them.

310
20:11.213 --> 20:13.366
You didn't even listen? That's harsh.

311
20:13.366 --> 20:15.384
They're not worth it.

312
20:15.384 --> 20:17.970
Music means different things to everyone.

313
20:17.970 --> 20:20.222
Give them a listen sometime.

314
20:20.222 --> 20:22.933
Every artist has a world to share.

315
20:22.933 --> 20:24.050
Enough.

316
20:24.050 --> 20:25.686
Let's get dinner.

317
20:25.686 --> 20:27.045
Out of nowhere?

318
20:27.045 --> 20:29.223
This time, I choose the food.

319
20:31.527 --> 20:36.327
Rich people love the view from up high.

320
20:36.327 --> 20:39.478
I prefer the ground floor, where I can see everyone.

321
20:44.246 --> 20:46.331
You like all kinds of meat?

322
20:46.331 --> 20:47.372
Sure.

323
20:47.372 --> 20:49.552
I'll even eat the bones.

324
20:50.519 --> 20:53.463
I'll treat you to pig's feet next time.

325
20:53.463 --> 20:55.340
They're really expensive, you know.

326
20:55.340 --> 20:57.740
I'll definitely pass.

327
21:06.601 --> 21:08.603
Let's start with ceviche,

328
21:08.603 --> 21:11.857
ravioli parmigiana, and en casserole.

329
21:11.857 --> 21:15.485
And chateaubriand for the steak.

330
21:15.485 --> 21:16.671
And the wine?

331
21:16.671 --> 21:19.250
Your Château Margaux is ready, sir.

332
21:19.250 --> 21:20.412
Oh, yeah.

333
21:26.330 --> 21:29.916
Even the menu sounds boring.

334
21:29.916 --> 21:33.420
Perhaps it's beyond your palate.

335
21:33.420 --> 21:35.589
And you?

336
21:35.589 --> 21:38.425
Are you even enjoying yourself?

337
21:38.425 --> 21:41.282
Never thought about it.

338
21:52.684 --> 21:55.065
Oh, this is good.

339
21:58.073 --> 21:59.798
Kwon Do Hyeok?

340
21:59.798 --> 22:01.733
Hey, Do Hyeok!

341
22:05.243 --> 22:07.037
Long time no see!

342
22:07.037 --> 22:08.538
Heard you went bankrupt.

343
22:08.538 --> 22:10.457
Is that why you came back to Korea?

344
22:10.457 --> 22:12.302
Just keep walking.

345
22:12.302 --> 22:15.087
I'm staying right here.

346
22:15.087 --> 22:17.333
Then get back to it.

347
22:17.333 --> 22:19.299
Still as prickly as ever.

348
22:19.299 --> 22:21.473
Because you're on a date?

349
22:24.047 --> 22:27.387
Your taste sure has changed.

350
22:29.059 --> 22:32.432
Who's this Tinky Winky?

351
22:42.197 --> 22:44.116
What did she just call me?

352
22:44.116 --> 22:46.660
You're interrupting. Get lost.

353
22:46.660 --> 22:48.266
Tinky Winky.

354
22:49.751 --> 22:52.380
I'll be on my way.

355
22:54.008 --> 22:55.961
Arrogant prick.

356
22:59.214 --> 23:02.354
You do have friends, right?

357
23:04.975 --> 23:06.127
You.

358
23:06.127 --> 23:08.847
Oh, guess not.

359
23:09.799 --> 23:12.321
What's your definition of a friend?

360
23:14.396 --> 23:17.774
Someone I can eat anything with and feel fine.

361
23:17.774 --> 23:19.860
You never get sick eating with me,

362
23:19.860 --> 23:22.396
so I must be your friend.

363
23:23.655 --> 23:26.366
With that little emotional intelligence,

364
23:26.366 --> 23:29.560
how did you dare make that bet?

365
23:29.560 --> 23:31.913
If you think a fancy dinner

366
23:31.913 --> 23:34.749
will make me fall for you,

367
23:34.749 --> 23:37.419
forget it.

368
23:37.419 --> 23:41.445
I'm winning this bet.

369
23:50.432 --> 23:51.966
This is the life.

370
24:02.903 --> 24:05.744
Too much wine will get you drunk.

371
24:07.199 --> 24:09.951
No matter how much I drink,

372
24:09.951 --> 24:13.371
I always make it home.

373
24:13.371 --> 24:15.737
Even if you have to crawl?

374
24:16.343 --> 24:17.964
Exactly.

375
24:19.837 --> 24:21.544
Another bottle?

376
24:27.482 --> 24:29.249
I love this.

377
24:54.888 --> 25:02.671
♪ The sky's so beautiful ♪

378
25:02.671 --> 25:04.256
Don't sing.

379
25:04.256 --> 25:10.804
♪ Like a violet-colored dream ♪

380
25:12.492 --> 25:14.474
- ♪ That sky... ♪ - That's enough.

381
25:14.474 --> 25:15.708
Time to go.

382
25:15.708 --> 25:21.231
♪ Like a violet-colored dream ♪

383
25:21.231 --> 25:24.068
♪ Oh, that sky above... ♪

384
25:24.943 --> 25:27.737
♪ I hope it's not a dream ♪

385
25:27.737 --> 25:29.155
If you don't get up now,

386
25:29.155 --> 25:31.681
you're paying the whole bill.

387
25:31.681 --> 25:33.326
Oh, no!

388
25:33.326 --> 25:35.829
I'm broke!

389
25:35.829 --> 25:40.208
I've only got 20,000 won to my name.

390
25:40.208 --> 25:45.046
I can't even afford pig's feet.

391
25:45.046 --> 25:47.424
What about the ten million I gave you?

392
25:47.424 --> 25:49.259
You spent it already?

393
25:49.259 --> 25:51.803
Oh, that?

394
25:51.803 --> 25:57.203
I threw it in that sleazy manager's face.

395
25:57.203 --> 25:59.227
Take this and get lost!

396
25:59.227 --> 26:03.293
You two-bit creep!

397
26:07.777 --> 26:12.991
♪ The sky's so beautiful ♪

398
26:12.991 --> 26:17.668
♪ The sky has abandoned me ♪

399
26:19.348 --> 26:20.373
Wait.

400
26:20.373 --> 26:22.099
Where are we off to?

401
26:23.168 --> 26:26.546
♪ People say... ♪

402
26:26.546 --> 26:29.466
♪ Will you settle down? ♪

403
26:29.466 --> 26:32.469
♪ My gestures are a question mark ♪

404
26:32.469 --> 26:36.181
♪ Maybe I left my mind behind ♪

405
26:36.181 --> 26:37.891
Lee Eun Chae!

406
26:37.891 --> 26:40.769
I'll get you a cab.

407
26:40.769 --> 26:43.355
♪ Pretending I'm normal... ♪

408
26:43.355 --> 26:44.522
Lee Eun...

409
26:44.522 --> 26:46.471
You said you could crawl home!

410
26:46.471 --> 26:48.804
How are you getting there?

411
26:50.195 --> 26:54.057
♪ I'll fly like a butterfly ♪

412
26:54.057 --> 26:55.784
Beats me.

413
26:55.784 --> 26:57.570
Driver's coming.

414
27:06.336 --> 27:08.880
Farewell, everyone!

415
27:08.880 --> 27:11.976
I'm leaving this miserable world behind!

416
27:11.976 --> 27:13.635
Hey! Where are you going?

417
27:13.635 --> 27:15.523
I called a driver!

418
27:15.523 --> 27:18.141
My house!

419
27:18.141 --> 27:19.683
You're running?

420
27:19.683 --> 27:21.523
For God's sake...

421
27:27.198 --> 27:29.188
Where am I?

422
27:29.188 --> 27:31.211
Is this my house?

423
27:41.290 --> 27:42.747
Hey! Don't run...

424
27:42.747 --> 27:43.790
Jeez.

425
27:43.790 --> 27:45.515
Stop running!

426
27:54.577 --> 27:55.747
Hey...

427
27:56.426 --> 27:58.367
Oh, that's me!

428
28:01.891 --> 28:03.645
Where am I?

429
28:33.590 --> 28:35.951
I feel sick.

430
28:38.350 --> 28:40.514
Lee Eun Chae.

431
28:40.514 --> 28:42.891
Lee Eun Chae, wake up.

432
28:42.891 --> 28:44.631
Get up.

433
28:49.898 --> 28:53.359
Thank you, driver.

434
28:53.359 --> 28:54.861
Oh, right.

435
28:54.861 --> 28:56.957
One second.

436
28:58.249 --> 29:00.658
Here it is.

437
29:00.658 --> 29:03.636
Here you go, sir.

438
29:10.420 --> 29:12.180
Ma'am.

439
29:12.680 --> 29:15.214
That's 14,000 won.

440
29:15.965 --> 29:18.885
Oh, really?

441
29:18.885 --> 29:20.470
That's odd.

442
29:20.470 --> 29:22.938
When did fares get so high?

443
29:23.932 --> 29:25.808
Here.

444
29:25.808 --> 29:28.338
Thank you.

445
29:33.075 --> 29:34.121
Ma'am.

446
29:34.121 --> 29:35.554
Your change.

447
29:35.554 --> 29:36.611
Oh, right.

448
29:36.611 --> 29:38.662
My change.

449
29:39.815 --> 29:42.882
Mind waiting while I count the cash?

450
29:42.882 --> 29:44.153
I'll just count it.

451
29:44.153 --> 29:46.162
Won't take long.

452
29:46.162 --> 29:48.402
Just a moment.

453
29:50.046 --> 29:52.085
One,

454
29:52.085 --> 29:54.170
two,

455
29:54.170 --> 29:55.964
three,

456
29:55.964 --> 29:57.215
four,

457
29:57.215 --> 29:58.341
five,

458
29:58.341 --> 30:00.093
six,

459
30:00.093 --> 30:02.470
seven?

460
30:02.470 --> 30:05.306
I think you gave me an extra bill.

461
30:05.306 --> 30:08.017
Oh, you did that on purpose!

462
30:08.017 --> 30:10.812
Wow, what an angel!

463
30:10.812 --> 30:13.398
How'd he know I was broke?

464
30:13.398 --> 30:15.777
She's completely wasted.

465
30:37.282 --> 30:38.922
Oh, my...

466
30:40.159 --> 30:42.869
You must be exhausted.

467
30:45.096 --> 30:48.089
Want me to sing for you?

468
30:49.865 --> 30:53.771
- Don't... - Singing gives me so much energy.

469
30:53.771 --> 30:58.147
It makes me feel better right here.

470
31:03.214 --> 31:10.904
♪ The sky is so beautiful ♪

471
31:12.081 --> 31:17.623
♪ Like a blue-violet dream ♪

472
31:19.005 --> 31:24.886
♪ The sky was on my side ♪

473
31:24.886 --> 31:28.264
♪ Will it happen again? ♪

474
31:28.264 --> 31:33.008
♪ I kept hoping for rain ♪

475
31:33.008 --> 31:36.856
♪ The truth is, I just wanted to see her ♪

476
31:36.856 --> 31:39.167
♪ My little... ♪

477
31:50.284 --> 31:52.679
Kwon Do Hyeok!

478
31:54.825 --> 31:56.630
Why are we here...

479
31:56.630 --> 31:58.821
Why is my wallet out here?

480
31:58.821 --> 31:59.837
What?

481
31:59.837 --> 32:02.239
Why is my bag here?

482
32:02.239 --> 32:04.342
What is going on?

483
32:04.342 --> 32:06.097
Kwon Do Hyeok, wake up!

484
32:06.097 --> 32:07.922
Kwon Do Hyeok!

485
32:08.680 --> 32:12.262
Is there anyone around?

486
32:12.262 --> 32:13.768
Wait, hold on.

487
32:13.768 --> 32:15.269
Hello?

488
32:15.269 --> 32:16.886
Wake up!

489
32:20.191 --> 32:21.702
Darn it.

490
32:21.702 --> 32:23.177
Hold on.

491
32:23.177 --> 32:25.613
Oh, no. 64 floors?

492
32:25.613 --> 32:27.365
I'll get motion sickness.

493
32:27.365 --> 32:29.952
What now? Keep going!

494
32:29.952 --> 32:31.318
Seriously...

495
32:34.711 --> 32:35.915
Go on in.

496
32:35.915 --> 32:38.068
You're so heavy!

497
32:42.408 --> 32:43.423
Jeez!

498
32:43.423 --> 32:44.852
Welcome home, boss.

499
32:44.852 --> 32:46.319
Oh, my!

500
32:47.603 --> 32:49.178
What?

501
32:49.178 --> 32:51.799
Even the greetings are automatic here.

502
32:53.085 --> 32:55.203
Why is this place so huge?

503
32:55.203 --> 32:57.971
All this space for one guy?

504
32:58.771 --> 32:59.897
Oh, there it is.

505
32:59.897 --> 33:01.118
Hold on.

506
33:01.974 --> 33:02.984
Come on.

507
33:02.984 --> 33:04.537
Almost there.

508
33:25.943 --> 33:28.592
What a lightweight.

509
33:35.010 --> 33:36.261
Wait.

510
33:37.913 --> 33:40.046
Off with this...

511
34:02.546 --> 34:05.917
He is handsome, though.

512
35:04.313 --> 35:07.553
This place has no personality.

513
35:08.025 --> 35:10.998
Not even a family photo.

514
35:10.998 --> 35:13.593
Not a graduation picture, either.

515
35:24.014 --> 35:26.714
What does this guy even eat?

516
35:56.824 --> 35:59.237
Did I sleep like this?

517
36:10.331 --> 36:12.711
How on earth...

518
36:17.778 --> 36:20.058
Lee Eun Chae...

519
37:04.759 --> 37:06.458
So warm...

520
37:06.458 --> 37:08.645
Nice and warm.

521
37:16.654 --> 37:18.494
Oh, crap.

522
37:20.491 --> 37:22.060
What the...

523
37:22.530 --> 37:24.322
I'm screwed.

524
37:27.712 --> 37:29.433
I'm going to puke.

525
37:47.018 --> 37:48.464
I feel sick...

526
38:01.968 --> 38:04.967
What are those muscles?

527
38:06.367 --> 38:09.553
He's sculpted like a statue.

528
39:25.616 --> 39:27.796
Coffee's on its way, boss.

529
39:35.290 --> 39:37.992
She must be out of her mind.

530
39:37.992 --> 39:39.032
[Dad]

531
39:47.680 --> 39:49.056
Hey, you little...

532
39:49.056 --> 39:50.982
While I'm still alive and kicking,

533
39:50.982 --> 39:52.096
you were out all night?

534
39:52.096 --> 39:54.609
I'll shave your head!

535
39:55.437 --> 39:56.939
Hello?

536
39:56.939 --> 39:58.107
Hello...

537
39:58.107 --> 39:59.158
Hey...

538
40:05.865 --> 40:08.951
What happens if you break curfew?

539
40:08.951 --> 40:10.204
He'll shave my head.

540
40:10.911 --> 40:12.856
Was she serious?

541
40:13.372 --> 40:16.845
She's already a mess. What if he shaves her head?

542
40:17.399 --> 40:19.199
Oh, man...

543
40:26.687 --> 40:29.581
No shoes, no wallet...

544
40:30.389 --> 40:32.748
I left my phone, too!

545
40:33.684 --> 40:37.250
How am I supposed to get home like this?

546
40:40.357 --> 40:43.650
"I just happened to catch a glimpse."

547
40:44.904 --> 40:46.390
Should I go with that?

548
40:53.662 --> 40:56.208
I stood there staring like an idiot.

549
40:56.208 --> 40:57.900
I mean, who showers

550
40:57.900 --> 41:00.628
without even locking the door?

551
41:00.628 --> 41:03.801
Then again, it's his place. Why would he?

552
41:03.801 --> 41:06.310
I'm the one who messed up.

553
41:11.803 --> 41:13.328
I don't know.

554
41:14.037 --> 41:15.548
Whatever.

555
41:18.365 --> 41:21.129
Boss, that woman's back.

556
41:44.484 --> 41:47.372
I didn't see a thing.

557
41:47.883 --> 41:50.434
You're a terrible liar.

558
41:51.153 --> 41:53.406
I've never been the only one naked.

559
41:53.406 --> 41:54.723
What does that mean...

560
41:54.723 --> 41:55.849
Gosh!

561
41:55.849 --> 41:58.936
Does he want to see me naked, too?

562
41:58.936 --> 42:02.106
Not like you to get so flustered.

563
42:02.106 --> 42:05.536
Could this be your first time?

564
42:06.162 --> 42:08.153
No!

565
42:08.153 --> 42:10.186
I've seen plenty!

566
42:11.323 --> 42:12.950
My first time? Please.

567
42:12.950 --> 42:15.953
I can't believe I'm even telling you this,

568
42:15.953 --> 42:18.027
but the number of guys

569
42:18.027 --> 42:21.041
who've shown me theirs could fill a truck!

570
42:21.041 --> 42:25.045
And they all looked way better than you!

571
42:25.045 --> 42:28.080
- Their skin was... - Then show me yours.

572
42:29.887 --> 42:32.192
Stay back!

573
42:32.990 --> 42:34.865
You...

574
42:34.865 --> 42:37.014
You're a sex addict. Right?

575
42:37.683 --> 42:39.960
What are you talking about?

576
42:40.769 --> 42:44.817
I meant, prove you've got that much experience.

577
42:45.512 --> 42:47.162
Darn it.

578
42:55.701 --> 42:59.830
If that's an act, she deserves an Oscar.

579
43:01.582 --> 43:03.301
Unbelievable.

580
43:05.044 --> 43:07.884
I'll shave your head!

581
43:11.775 --> 43:13.510
I'll drive you.

582
43:13.510 --> 43:17.241
- No, thanks! - It's for my own peace of mind.

583
43:18.849 --> 43:20.026
But...

584
43:24.063 --> 43:27.456
Does he really think I'll fall for that?

585
43:29.311 --> 43:32.416
Still, saves me taxi fare.

586
43:36.909 --> 43:41.413
If the elevator breaks or there's a blackout,

587
43:41.413 --> 43:44.430
do you have to climb 64 floors?

588
43:44.430 --> 43:47.381
I've never met anyone who worries about that.

589
43:47.381 --> 43:50.047
You never know what could happen.

590
43:50.047 --> 43:53.501
No matter what happens, you come when your boss calls.

591
43:53.501 --> 43:54.535
No way.

592
43:54.535 --> 43:56.878
I'd never make it up all those stairs.

593
43:56.878 --> 44:00.056
So you'd leave your boss trapped up here?

594
44:00.056 --> 44:02.476
Your own fault. For living this high up.

595
44:02.476 --> 44:05.954
It's called success, not my own fault.

596
44:05.954 --> 44:07.940
Success or not,

597
44:07.940 --> 44:10.840
I'm not climbing all the way up here.

598
44:13.862 --> 44:19.329
If I ever walked up 64 floors,

599
44:19.329 --> 44:22.788
it'd take the power of love.

600
44:22.788 --> 44:24.338
"Love?"

601
44:26.790 --> 44:28.198
Well...

602
44:28.763 --> 44:31.450
That would never happen.

603
44:41.088 --> 44:42.926
Are you getting in?

604
44:42.926 --> 44:45.334
The power of love?

605
44:53.722 --> 44:56.445
Feels like a free-fall ride.

606
44:59.609 --> 45:01.535
If I ever came all this way for you,

607
45:01.535 --> 45:04.843
it'd take the power of love.

608
45:23.849 --> 45:26.647
Maybe I should play some music.

609
45:31.857 --> 45:34.234
Too loud. Turn it off.

610
45:34.234 --> 45:36.940
It's too quiet without it...

611
46:02.904 --> 46:06.725
You don't seem worried about getting caught staying out.

612
46:06.725 --> 46:11.671
It's called mind over matter.

613
46:28.015 --> 46:29.448
I'm off.

614
46:33.794 --> 46:35.546
He must be asleep.

615
46:35.546 --> 46:36.913
Okay.

616
46:37.434 --> 46:38.933
Goodbye!

617
47:30.892 --> 47:32.311
Back?

618
47:32.311 --> 47:33.633
Dad!

619
47:35.439 --> 47:36.815
Oh, my God!

620
47:36.815 --> 47:39.192
Dad! No way... Are you serious?

621
47:39.192 --> 47:40.623
- Oh, no! - Get over here!

622
47:40.623 --> 47:41.583
Calm down, Dad!

623
47:41.583 --> 47:42.779
- How dare... - Please!

624
47:42.779 --> 47:43.912
- Sorry! - Get over here!

625
47:56.467 --> 47:57.502
Drive!

626
47:57.502 --> 47:59.421
Why? What's going on?

627
47:59.421 --> 48:01.543
Dad's chasing me with hair clippers!

628
48:01.543 --> 48:03.592
He really was going to shave your head?

629
48:03.592 --> 48:05.965
Come on! Drive already!

630
48:05.965 --> 48:07.346
Put your seat belt on!

631
48:07.346 --> 48:09.151
Okay, okay!

632
48:18.815 --> 48:20.613
Where to?

633
48:23.172 --> 48:25.133
Where am I driving?

634
48:38.085 --> 48:41.338
We need to head to work anyway...

635
48:41.338 --> 48:43.591
Let's get breakfast first.

636
48:46.684 --> 48:50.384
[Seoul Grandma's Beef Head Soup]

637
48:59.720 --> 49:02.321
[Seoul Grandma's Beef Head Soup]

638
49:10.412 --> 49:11.952
Careful, it's hot.

639
49:11.952 --> 49:13.737
Thank you.

640
49:13.737 --> 49:15.683
Oh, that looks good.

641
49:18.458 --> 49:19.584
Enjoy your meal.

642
49:19.584 --> 49:21.837
Thank you.

643
49:21.837 --> 49:23.784
Now, like this...

644
49:23.784 --> 49:26.805
Add a good scoop of rice...

645
49:28.802 --> 49:30.113
So...

646
49:30.113 --> 49:31.542
Cow's head, huh?

647
49:32.344 --> 49:34.957
They make the broth from beef head,

648
49:34.957 --> 49:36.643
then add the meat,

649
49:36.643 --> 49:38.103
with chopped scallions...

650
49:38.103 --> 49:39.737
Enough.

651
49:42.149 --> 49:43.817
Try it.

652
49:43.817 --> 49:45.152
It's good for you.

653
49:45.152 --> 49:47.355
My body's fine as it is.

654
49:47.988 --> 49:50.948
You have to add all the good stuff.

655
49:53.910 --> 49:57.061
Your fridge was completely empty.

656
49:57.061 --> 49:58.935
Don't you eat at home?

657
49:58.935 --> 50:01.189
No, I don't.

658
50:01.189 --> 50:02.919
Then...

659
50:02.919 --> 50:05.808
What do you have when you're hungry?

660
50:06.381 --> 50:07.382
Wine...

661
50:07.382 --> 50:10.177
and water?

662
50:10.177 --> 50:13.001
Wait, so...

663
50:13.001 --> 50:14.881
Do you just never get hungry?

664
50:14.881 --> 50:18.379
Eating meals on a fixed schedule...

665
50:18.379 --> 50:20.395
Isn't that a waste of time?

666
50:20.395 --> 50:22.039
So...

667
50:23.126 --> 50:25.652
You only have a sex drive, huh?

668
50:35.202 --> 50:36.762
Have you ever heard

669
50:36.762 --> 50:40.502
the saying "food gives you strength?"

670
50:40.502 --> 50:43.311
But I think it's not just the body.

671
50:43.311 --> 50:45.680
Food feeds the heart, too.

672
50:45.680 --> 50:49.925
Sitting down face-to-face, and sharing a meal...

673
50:49.925 --> 50:52.471
That's something special.

674
50:59.870 --> 51:02.223
So go on, try it.

675
51:03.146 --> 51:05.482
I have to do everything for you?

676
51:05.482 --> 51:09.120
If I use my own spoon, you'll complain it's gross again.

677
51:09.120 --> 51:11.986
Yeah... Like this.

678
51:11.986 --> 51:13.555
Eat up.

679
51:16.471 --> 51:18.462
You'll be amazed.

680
51:27.864 --> 51:29.501
Good, right?

681
51:31.591 --> 51:33.597
Surprised?

682
51:38.974 --> 51:40.548
Look at you.

683
51:49.764 --> 51:52.100
I'm stuffed.

684
51:57.409 --> 51:58.569
Jin Woo.

685
51:59.249 --> 52:01.121
Where are you now?

686
52:01.121 --> 52:03.020
We've all been worried sick.

687
52:03.020 --> 52:05.226
We had a work dinner, so I crashed at the office.

688
52:05.226 --> 52:06.653
Don't worry.

689
52:06.653 --> 52:08.378
How can we not worry?

690
52:08.378 --> 52:11.214
It's dangerous out there.

691
52:11.214 --> 52:13.901
Especially for a pretty girl like you.

692
52:13.901 --> 52:18.385
True. There are so many creeps out there.

693
52:19.472 --> 52:22.292
That's why your dad was worried.

694
52:22.873 --> 52:28.481
I'm at work now, so please talk to Dad for me.

695
52:28.481 --> 52:29.893
Okay.

696
52:30.984 --> 52:32.819
"Work?"

697
52:32.819 --> 52:35.489
You're quite the liar.

698
52:35.489 --> 52:39.826
I can't tell him I slept at your place, can I?

699
52:39.826 --> 52:43.819
You're making it sound like something happened between us.

700
52:48.332 --> 52:49.377
Aren't you getting in?

701
52:49.377 --> 52:50.962
Forget it.

702
52:50.962 --> 52:54.642
People will really think something happened between us.

703
52:54.642 --> 52:55.670
Why?

704
52:55.670 --> 52:58.094
You said nothing happened.

705
52:58.094 --> 53:00.520
Who cares what people think?

706
53:18.499 --> 53:19.532
What?

707
53:19.532 --> 53:21.232
They came together?

708
53:30.919 --> 53:35.215
For New OX's new album, we went with fiery red.

709
53:35.215 --> 53:38.468
The performance will be bold, too.

710
53:38.468 --> 53:40.273
Nice work.

711
53:41.481 --> 53:43.890
Music isn't about genre.

712
53:43.890 --> 53:46.203
It's about the world an artist creates.

713
53:46.203 --> 53:50.063
Whether it's a song or an instrumental.

714
53:50.063 --> 53:51.561
But...

715
53:51.561 --> 53:55.449
What kind of world has New OX built?

716
53:56.923 --> 53:58.578
What world?

717
53:58.578 --> 54:00.077
Do you know?

718
54:00.077 --> 54:01.283
What?

719
54:03.076 --> 54:05.322
You said I know nothing about idols, huh?

720
54:05.322 --> 54:06.923
Yes.

721
54:06.923 --> 54:09.043
And you're right.

722
54:09.043 --> 54:12.780
Then even someone like me should buy into their world

723
54:12.780 --> 54:15.388
and feel something.

724
54:15.388 --> 54:16.477
Right?

725
54:16.477 --> 54:19.477
Shouldn't they have a universe like that?

726
54:26.212 --> 54:27.698
Well...

727
54:34.916 --> 54:37.027
What are we, novelists?

728
54:37.027 --> 54:39.154
What's with all this universe talk?

729
54:39.154 --> 54:40.964
Isn't that a video game thing?

730
54:40.964 --> 54:42.602
No, that's not it.

731
54:56.004 --> 54:59.400
You spent the ten million already?

732
54:59.400 --> 55:01.917
Oh, that?

733
55:01.917 --> 55:06.848
I threw it in that sleazy manager's face!

734
55:06.848 --> 55:08.958
Take this and get lost!

735
55:08.958 --> 55:12.712
You two-bit creep!

736
55:17.609 --> 55:18.651
Yes, sir.

737
55:18.651 --> 55:20.307
Come in for a moment.

738
55:28.845 --> 55:33.458
Find out what happened to Eun Chae at her previous job.

739
55:33.458 --> 55:35.486
Lee Eun Chae?

740
55:35.486 --> 55:36.954
Yes.

741
55:41.841 --> 55:43.266
Understood.

742
56:53.947 --> 56:57.125
I need data on the kind of men women fall for.

743
56:57.125 --> 56:58.972
She looks smitten already.

744
56:58.972 --> 57:00.420
Don't try to bait me like this.

745
57:00.420 --> 57:02.046
It only makes me dislike you more.

746
57:02.046 --> 57:03.381
Why do you need money?

747
57:03.381 --> 57:06.009
Because I owe a dangerous rich heir money.

748
57:06.009 --> 57:07.492
Eun Chae, do you want a blind date?

749
57:07.492 --> 57:10.494
Why does she get under my skin?

750
57:10.494 --> 57:13.183
Next show, I'll buy them myself.

751
57:13.183 --> 57:14.851
Fine! I'm Soo!

752
57:14.851 --> 57:16.474
How about living together for three days?

753
57:16.474 --> 57:18.151
You really came?

754
57:18.151 --> 57:20.058
Then can I kiss you?
